  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nBeautifully transformed and thoughtfully redesigned, this stunning home offers a fresh take on contemporary coastal living in one of the North Shore’s most desirable seaside suburbs.\r\n\r\nShowcasing a comprehensive renovation, the home now delivers an exceptional blend of style, space and functionality. Featuring three well-appointed bedrooms, three bathrooms, two separate living areas and a dedicated dining space, the thoughtfully configured layout offers outstanding flexibility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nLight-filled interiors create a warm and inviting atmosphere, while the multiple living spaces provide room for everyone to relax, entertain and enjoy their own space. The seamless connection between indoor and outdoor living further enhances the home’s appeal, with glimpses of the sea adding a special coastal touch.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the sought-after school zoning, including Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College, while the nearby beach, local amenities and vibrant coastal community make this location truly special.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a first-home buyer, a young family or an astute investor, this beautifully transformed property represents an exceptional entry-level opportunity in the highly sought-after Rothesay Bay market — offering the perfect balance of modern comfort, generous living spaces and coastal lifestyle at an appealing entry point into this desirable seaside suburb.\r\n\r\n* Please note this is the front/roadside property.",
